<!--
  Empty AspectJ load-time weaving configuration, mounted over the base image's
  /usr/local/tomcat/lib/aop.xml in docker-compose_otel.yaml.

  The base image ships a Kieker aop.xml at that path. The AspectJ weaver
  aggregates every aop.xml on the classpath, so that file's <weaver> excludes
  (e.g. AbstractCRUDEndpoint, which the persistence endpoints inherit) and its
  concrete-aspect (which fails to register and disables the weaver on some
  class loaders) would otherwise apply to the request-boundary logging weave as
  well. Mounting this empty file in the OTel scenario removes the Kieker
  weaving config from the aggregate, leaving only the SecLogTrace aop.xml in
  registryclient. The base image is unchanged, so the Kieker Compose scenario
  still uses the real Kieker aop.xml.
-->
<aspectj>
</aspectj>
